Package: NANNO
Title: Nitrogen Isotope Biogeochemical Model for Freshwaters
Version: 1.1.0
Date: 2026-11-05
Authors@R: person("Jason", "Venkiteswaran",
                  email = "jason.venkiteswaran@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6574-7071"))
Description: Creates a nitrogen isotope biogeochemical model for use in
    freshwaters via the simecol package. The model forward simulates changes
    in nitrogen concentrations and isotopic ratios, and can be used
    iteratively to model-fit field data. It was initially developed to
    describe changes in nitrogen concentrations and isotopic ratios in a
    wastewater treatment plant plume in a river.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0),
    simecol
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4),
    gridExtra (>= 2.3),
    methods,
    tidyr (>= 1.0),
    tools
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
